{
  "id": "p08-a-04",
  "title_zh": "缩小贸易课程项目的范围并区分解释因素",
  "topic_id": "learning",
  "scenario": {
    "id": "trade-project-evidence-scope",
    "label_zh": "限定贸易项目的证据范围",
    "goal_zh": "选定两座城市的货运案例，分开核对基础设施和物价资料而不把变化全部归因于全球化"
  },
  "participants": [
    "Priya",
    "Dan"
  ],
  "context_zh": "两名学生为经济地理课程缩小研究项目的范围。",
  "author": "author-phase08-a",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "p08-a-04-s01",
      "speaker": "Priya",
      "text": "Our title is 'How globalization changed the world'. That's far too much for ten minutes."
    },
    {
      "id": "p08-a-04-s02",
      "speaker": "Dan",
      "text": "Could we follow one product as it's shipped around the globe instead?"
    },
    {
      "id": "p08-a-04-s03",
      "speaker": "Priya",
      "text": "Yes. We have records from two industrial cities that make bicycle parts."
    },
    {
      "id": "p08-a-04-s04",
      "speaker": "Dan",
      "text": "The report says deliveries became increasingly reliable after the new railway opened."
    },
    {
      "id": "p08-a-04-s05",
      "speaker": "Priya",
      "text": "Then transport infrastructure should be one part of our explanation, not just international trade."
    },
    {
      "id": "p08-a-04-s06",
      "speaker": "Dan",
      "text": "What about the higher prices? Shall we say they prove the trade links were a mistake?"
    },
    {
      "id": "p08-a-04-s07",
      "speaker": "Priya",
      "text": "No. We haven't separated the effect of inflation from changes in shipping costs."
    },
    {
      "id": "p08-a-04-s08",
      "speaker": "Dan",
      "text": "I'll check those price figures. You can trace the route and the railway dates."
    },
    {
      "id": "p08-a-04-s09",
      "speaker": "Priya",
      "text": "Agreed. We'll compare these two cities and make the limits clear."
    }
  ],
